// Horror from the Deep - combat content (quest_horror). Migrated from the raw 377 cache dump
// (content/scripts/_unpack/377/all.npc), same pattern as areas/area_waterbirth/configs/
// dagannoth_kings.npc: base appearance/model/anim fields below "op2=Attack" (or "vislevel=100" where
// op2 already exists) are untouched raw cache values, everything from "param=slayer_category" onward
// (existing in the cache) plus the stat/param block after it (new) wires these into skill_combat.
//
// Stats sourced from the OSRS wiki for "Dagannoth (Horror from the Deep)" and "Dagannoth Mother":
// both share the exact same base stat block (level 100, 120 hp, 78 atk/str, 81 def, 1 magic, 50
// ranged, stab melee, max hit 9, all attack/defence bonuses +0, attack speed 4 ticks) - Mother's is
// just layered with the elemental/style weakness-cycling mechanic on top (see quest_horror_combat.rs2
// and the matching edits in skill_combat/scripts/player/player_{melee,ranged,magic}.rs2). Explicitly
// excludes the 25 Jun 2025 "35% earth spell weakness" update added to the generic Dagannoth - that
// postdates this server's January 2006 target era.
//
// horror_dagannoth_jr1/jr2/jr3 (emergence animation stages, no op2/combat params - not fought
// directly) precede jr4 in the cache; horror_dagganoth_aira/airb/airc are Dagannoth Mother's
// equivalent emergence stages. Wiring the actual emergence sequence (and where either of these
// spawns in the first place) is blocked on the same missing Waterbirth-area/dungeon coordinates
// flagged in the project doc - only the fightable end-states (jr4, and Mother's six phases) get
// combat capability here.

[horror_dagannoth_jr4]
name=Dagannoth
desc=A horror from the ocean depths...
model1=poh_dagganoth_8
recol1s=13740
recol1d=14796
recol2s=12683
recol2d=13739
recol3s=11626
recol3d=13706
